{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "zh-Hant",
  "language_raw": "Trad_Chinese",
  "source": "message/dat/Trad_Chinese/script/t06.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/Trad_Chinese/script/t06.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "t06_01",
      "hash64": "136B7FCA250D62D9",
      "text": "這裡是錦匯鎮。\\n看起來拉拉雜雜的吧？\\r\\n真是鎮如其名！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "t06_10",
      "hash64": "136F04CA25107AAF",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳去過寶食堂了嗎？\\n聽說道館館主是那裡的常客！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "t06_18",
      "hash64": "136F0CCA25108847",
      "text": "我們的料理是帕底亞第一美味！\\n歡迎來嚐嚐看！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "t06_19",
      "hash64": "136F0BCA25108694",
      "text": "歡迎光臨頂新鮮餐廳！\\n料理富含礦物質喔～",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "t06_22",
      "hash64": "136514CA2508415A",
      "text": "我想[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的寶可夢\\n應該很想在本店用餐喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "t06_31",
      "hash64": "136817CA250A7C4A",
      "text": "我聽說很貴的餐廳\\n會有服裝規定。\\r\\n到底會有什麼樣的規定呢……？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "t06_32",
      "hash64": "136816CA250A7A97",
      "text": "我要存零用錢，\\n讓寶可夢吃好吃的東西～",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "t06_33",
      "hash64": "136815CA250A78E4",
      "text": "辣～乎乎的料理是本店的拿手菜！\\n來喔～來喔～快來嚐嚐！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "t06_42",
      "hash64": "135E04CA2502077C",
      "text": "現在不用預約\\n也能在本店用餐。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "t06_59",
      "hash64": "136183CA25051520",
      "text": "有個好大的門擋著，\\n沒辦法到帕底亞巨坑去。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "t06_60",
      "hash64": "13577ACA24FCB150",
      "text": "聽說門的後方有個叫零區閘口的設施，\\n那裡禁止任何人進入。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "t06_61",
      "hash64": "13577BCA24FCB303",
      "text": "錦匯鎮知名的\\n寶食堂就在這裡～！\\c\\n如果正在參加道館測驗，\\n我們還提供秘密菜單喔～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "t06_65",
      "hash64": "13577FCA24FCB9CF",
      "text": "我聽說寶食堂可以幫忙\\n改變寶可夢的太晶屬性，\\r\\n但主廚理都不理我……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "t06_79",
      "hash64": "135A87CA24FEFD3E",
      "text": "來個三明治如何呀？\\n不管肚子餓不餓都歡迎喔～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "t06_101",
      "hash64": "161FC17CFB005A7A",
      "text": "在爬霜抹山之前，\\n我會來錦匯鎮的商店街用餐，\\r\\n好增強體力。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "t06_106",
      "hash64": "161FBC7CFB0051FB",
      "text": "這個城鎮是帕底亞的交通要衝。\\c\\n因為有很多從外地來訪的人，\\n自然而然地餐飲店就越來越多了。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "t06_107",
      "hash64": "161FBB7CFB005048",
      "text": "我的藏飽栗鼠最近\\n變得越來越大隻……\\r\\n或許我該搬到比較大的房子？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "t06_109",
      "hash64": "161FB97CFB004CE2",
      "text": "霜抹山的路途十分險峻！\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳如果要去，要做好準備才行。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "t06_115",
      "hash64": "161C397CFAFD3D8B",
      "text": "這個城鎮裡沒有對戰場。\\n不曉得在哪裡和道館館主對戰呢？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "t06_117",
      "hash64": "161C3B7CFAFD40F1",
      "text": "在很久很久以前樓梯下面是個劇場，\\n在那裡可以觀賞到舞台劇或演唱會。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "t06_133",
      "hash64": "1623277CFB033DA3",
      "text": "年輕人，[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳是學生嗎？\\n看來現在是校外研究的季節。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
